ckend/connectionPoolAndThroughput/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"커넥션 풀의 보이지 않는 잠금 — 성능 버그 3건을 실측으로 추적하다"}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/backend/connectionPoolAndThroughput/","series":"Sunchak 개발기"}},"staticQueryHashes":["1290411722","346855881"],"slicesMap":{}}